Subject: [PATCH] Add Ctrl+Shift+D shortcut to delete the currently playing
 item

Shows the usual delete confirmation dialog with the Delete button
focused, so Enter confirms and Escape cancels. Does nothing when
nothing is playing, and shows an error when the user cannot delete
the item.
